The '''New Territories''' was the northernmost region of [[the galaxy]]. It shared borders with the [[Unknown Regions]] westward, [[the Interior]] southward, and [[the Slice]] eastward.<ref name="GEG">''[[Star Wars: The Galactic Explorer's Guide]]''</ref> During the [[Clone Wars]], part of the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]]'s territory stretched from the New Territories to [[Hutt Space]].<ref name="RotS">''[[Rise of the Separatists]]''</ref>

{{Sec-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The New Territories region originated in the [[2009]] [[Star Wars Legends|Legends]] reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]'', which was written by [[Jason Fry]] and [[Daniel Wallace]].<ref name="EA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref> ''[[Star Wars: The Galactic Explorer's Guide]]'' depicts the New Territories in a stylized map that does not match the prior [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] definition, extending it to include most of the [[Trans-Hydian Borderlands]] and the [[Northern Dependencies]].<ref name="GEG" /> The guide's author [[Jason Fry]] has stated that the map was developed for ease of readability on a mobile phone for use in the Disney parks, and that its borders should not be considered definitive or overriding other sources.<ref name="Fry">{{EmailCite|email=File:AtlasEmail-2025-08-31.png|creator=[[Jason Fry]]|date=2025-08-31}}</ref>


